<title>UK: United News says has 56 pct of Blenheim.</title>
<headline>United News says has 56 pct of Blenheim.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>United News &amp; Media said it controlled 56.5 percent of recommended bid target Blenheim Plc after buying a further 5.5 million shares following its announcement of the offer earlier today.</p>
<p>Earlier, United News &amp; Media had said it held 51 percent of the exhibitions organiser.</p>
<p>United News &amp; Media trumped rivals for Blenheim with a 592.5 million stg agreed bid.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
